# Circle of Protection: Red prevents the chosen red source's next damage this turn (CR 615.1). Colorless Ornithopter and
# green Llanowar Elves are not red sources, so they are refused (CR 105.2); one shield stops only the next damage of the
# chosen source, so the same creature deals damage the next turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Circle of Protection: Red
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Raging Goblin
Raging Goblin
Llanowar Elves
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Circle of Protection: Red.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Raging Goblin.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Raging Goblin.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T4 Bot2.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Circle of Protection: Red.Activate
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
! Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Choose(Raging Goblin#1)
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Raging Goblin#1; Raging Goblin#2; Llanowar Elves > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Life = 18
[T6 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Raging Goblin#1; Raging Goblin#2; Llanowar Elves > Bot1)
[T6 Bot2.Main2]

